sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Admin
  participant API as AdminService
  participant R as SettingsRegistry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>API: PUT /admin/settings/:key {value}
  API->>DB: BEGIN, load current settings
  API->>R: settingError(key, value, current)
  alt unknown key, wrong type or out of range
    API-->>A: 422 with reason
  end
  API->>DB: upsert platform_settings (updated_by = admin)
  API->>DB: insert admin_audit_logs (setting.update, before, after)
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>A: 200 updated settings
